   "scale": "village",
   "text": "⛓️ Chidi brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned.\nThe village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Chidi speaks at Stonebridge's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST.\nThree weeks. That's how long before a handshake is a relationship — the System will say so when it's true. Tend this fire.\n📓 Codex: First link formed with Stonebridge. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons."
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
